Data notice
- The code fetches public data from the Reserve Bank of India (rbi.org.in) and
  Financial Benchmarks India Pvt Ltd (fbil.org.in). RBI and FBIL own that data.
- The repository does not ship a dataset. Each user builds a local copy with
  `imda backfill`. tests/fixtures/ holds short recorded samples, used only so the
  test suite runs offline.
- FBIL benchmarks need FBIL's authorisation for commercial use or redistribution.
  See docs/LIMITATIONS.md.
- No secrets, API keys, or real customer data are included. Amounts and payment
  dates in examples are made up.
